<title>QATAR: Qatar busts Asian drugs ring, arrests four.</title>
<headline>Qatar busts Asian drugs ring, arrests four.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Asians have been arrested in Qartar for possessing about 90 kg (198 lbs) of hashish, the official Qatar News Agency reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The agency did not give the nationality of the Asians nor did it say when the arrest took place.</p>
<p>Unlike neighbouring Saudi Arabia, Qatar does not usually execute drug offenders.</p>
</text>
